# Make Custom App Rules Loader

When the `make-custom-app` skill (`~/.cursor/skills/make-custom-app/SKILL.md`) is active in this session, you **MUST** read and follow ALL of these rule files before answering any Make-app-related question:

1. `~/.cursor/rules/make-custom-app/work-discipline.mdc`
2. `~/.cursor/rules/make-custom-app/make-app-auto-actions.mdc`
3. `~/.cursor/rules/make-custom-app/make-app-ux-guideline.mdc`
4. `~/.cursor/rules/make-custom-app/make-app-code-review.mdc`
5. `~/.cursor/rules/make-custom-app/version-sync.mdc`

**Do NOT skip any.** Read them once at the start, then follow throughout the session.

When the skill is NOT active, ignore this rule entirely.
